Orleans.Lattice repository-context embedding companion image
============================================================

This image is derived from and based on Onyx's model server
(https://github.com/onyx-dot-app/onyx, backend/model_server and
backend/Dockerfile.model_server). That component sits outside Onyx's ee/
directories and is licensed under the MIT (Expat) License. The MIT copyright
notice is retained below, as the license requires.

The published base image used is onyxdotapp/onyx-model-server. This project adds
only a thin derived Dockerfile (pinned tag, CPU-default and embedding-only
posture, health check, documentation) and no Onyx source code.

